,"url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50576889/top-fictional-sports-series-21st-century","type":"Story","byline":"Brianna Williams","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"The oldest grudge in football","description":"When Texas Tech and its brash benefactor bought their way into the college football big time, they were settling an old West Texas score.","published":"2026-11-26T13:12:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50427039/texas-tech-puf-cody-campbell","type":"Story","byline":"Dave Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Take a 360-degree look at college football's iconic rivalry trophies","description":"Whether ancient, animal or absurd, college football's rivalry trophies take many shapes.","published":"2026-11-26T13:09:54.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/id/50371090/college-football-rivalry-trophies","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"USC band won't perform at UCLA football game after members vandalized campus","description":"The USC Trojan Marching Band will not perform during Saturday's rivalry game against UCLA after members of the band vandalized a portion of UCLA's campus.","published":"2026-11-26T14:39:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50600615/usc-band-perform-members-vandalized-ucla-campus","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Kent State TD overturned by replay was incorrect decision, MAC says","description":"A Kent State touchdown catch should not have been overturned by replay to incomplete at the end of Tuesday's 17-12 loss to Eastern Michigan, the Mid-American Conference said Wednesday.","published":"2026-11-25T23:05:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50597875/kent-state-td-overturned-replay-was-incorrect-mac-says","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4837460/audavion-collins","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audavion_Collins"},"pick":{"pick":54,"round":2,"team":"LAR","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Audavion Collins","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audavion_Collins","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:38Z","intro":"Audavion Collins is an American college football cornerback for the Penn State Nittany Lions. He previously played for the Mississippi State Bulldogs.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Collins attended Newton High School in Covington, Georgia. As a senior he had 62 tackles with one interception and also had five receptions for 150 yards and two touchdowns. He committed to Mississippi State University to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Collins did not play in a game his lone season at Mississippi State in 2022. He entered the transfer portal after the season and committed to Penn State. He played in six games his first year at Penn State in 2023 and had three tackles and 16 games in 2024, recording 26 tackles and an interception. Collins became a starter in 2025, starting all 13 games and finishing the season with 47 tackles. He returned to Penn State for the 2026 season."}]}}